// One 2-item STR# per command ([1] "A2" title repeated, [2] the one
// command) instead of a single flat list — see the note in
// ResourceIds.hpp about why a single [title, cmd, cmd, ...] STR# folds
// everything after the first command into a submenu instead of staying
// flat under "A2".
